  "@type": "SoftwareSourceCode",
  "identifier": "cvmdata",
  "description": "Provides a tidy API to the open data published by the Brazilian Securities and Exchange Commission ('CVM' - Comissao de Valores Mobiliarios). The package's first release covers core publicly-traded-company datasets: 'cad' (company registry), 'itr' (quarterly financial statements), 'dfp' (annual financial statements) and 'fre' (reference form, including ESG/governance tables). Column names, table names, categorical values and free text are preserved in Portuguese as published by 'CVM'; function names, arguments and metadata attributes are in English following the rOpenSci and tidyverse conventions. By default data is read from a weekly refreshed 'Parquet' mirror of the portal maintained by the package author in 'GitHub' Releases; the official portal can be read directly instead. Future releases will expand coverage to investment funds and other regulated entity classes.",
  "name": "cvmdata: Tidy Access to Brazilian CVM Open Data",
